7Z","value":45,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4807670","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4272810-1846651706690031","game_id":"steam-4272810","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 The Demo Is Live! The Whistle Blows, You Make the Call!","summary":"Hello, everyone!We're thrilled to announce that the Pro Football Referee demo is officially live and available to play for free! 🥳Ever dreamed of building a football refereeing career from the very bottom all the way to the top? Then this game is for you! 🔥🔥Start as an unknown referee in the lower leagues and work your way up through controversial decisions, power struggles, and behind-the-scenes connections.Build your network, navigate the politics of football, and even use insider information ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:38:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690031","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4272810-1833968530892909","game_id":"steam-4272810","kind":"update","title":"Development Update #3 – Building a Football World Beyond the Pitch","summary":"🌍 Building a Football World Beyond the PitchOver the past few weeks, our focus has expanded far beyond the match itself.While the referee match system is approaching completion, we've been integrating the larger football ecosystem that surrounds your career.Our goal has never been to create just another match simulator.We want to create a living football world where every decision, every relationship and every season matters.Systems currently in development include:News & MediaLeaguesWorld CupYo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-30T05:51:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530892909","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4272810-1830797770244004","game_id":"steam-4272810","kind":"update","title":"Development Update #2 – The Pitch Comes Alive: Crowd, Offside & Dynamic Weather","summary":"This is where your referee journey starts to come alive !🏟️ Full Crowd System is LiveA massive match deserves a massive crowd.The stands are now fully packed, bringing real match atmosphere to every game. From small matches to big moments, the stadium finally feels alive.👉🚩 Offside System – Precision MattersWe’ve been refining the offside system to make it as realistic as possible.Now you can:Control the offside line yourselfMake the final call based on your own judgmentEvery decision matters — ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-28T02:08:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770244004","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:21:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4272810-1828894815556653","game_id":"steam-4272810","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 Pro Football Referee is here!","summary":"Hello everyone!We’re excited to announce that the store page for Pro Football Referee is now officially live! 🥳If you’ve ever wanted to experience the journey of a football referee starting from the bottom and working your way to the top, this game is for you! 🔥🔥Starting as an unknown lower-league referee, you’ll face controversial calls, power struggles, social networking, and even use insider information and financial influence to expand your power both on and off the pitch. You are the one wh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-02T07:26:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815556653","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:2